    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Raised on the sprawling ranches and breeding sanctuaries of the Eldeen Reaches, you bond with beasts and magebred monstrosities alike. House Vadalis guides biological evolution under the Mark of Handling.</p><p>Choose two attribute boosts. One must be to <strong>Wisdom</strong> or <strong>Strength</strong>, and one is a free attribute boost.</p><p>You're trained in the <strong>Nature</strong> skill and the <strong>House Vadalis Lore</strong> skill. You gain the <strong>Train Animal</strong> skill feat. You have access to Mark of Handling feats.</p>"
